WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6ae152bbbf9d11c475011619 — Episode 76 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
How long until we get a result?

2
00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.800
The license plates are fake.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.200
We're tracking them through traffic camps.

4
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.600
Please give us some time.

5
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:13.500
She is safe as long as you cooperate.

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.500
What do you want?

7
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500
20 million unmarked cash.

8
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.700
Two hours.

9
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.900
Call the police and she's dead.

10
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.500
Put Willie on the phone.

11
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.100
I need to know she is alive.

12
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.130
Daddy, it's so dark.

13
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.930
Willie, don't be scared.

14
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.730
Daddy is coming right now.

15
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:34.130
Remember to take deep breaths and count your numbers, okay?

16
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.700
Text you the address.

17
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.900
Come alone.

18
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:47.790
No tricks.

19
00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.190
Tech is already tracking that call.

20
00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.790
That speaking rhythm.

21
00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:52.790
I know it.

22
00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.390
It is Chase Wilson.

23
00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.190
How can you tell?

24
00:00:55.190 --> 00:01:01.920
I remember his tone perfectly and his verbal ticks.

25
00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.120
Why aren't Chase and my dad picking up?

26
00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.920
They said they'd keep me updated.

27
00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.320
Did something go wrong?

28
00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.120
What could possibly go wrong?

29
00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:10.120
Your dad is there.

30
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.120
Willa is perfectly safe.

31
00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:15.920
Mom, Willa is your granddaughter.

32
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.720
How are you not worried at all?

33
00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.920
Don't paint me as cold-blooded.

34
00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.520
We decided this together.

35
00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:25.720
If something goes south, don't you dare pin it all on me.

36
00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.920
What's the point of pointing fingers right now?

37
00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.120
We have to make sure she's safe.

38
00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:34.590
Could that be impossible?

39
00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:35.990
Chase said it would be safe.

40
00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:36.990
The plates were fake.

41
00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.590
How could the cops move so fast?

42
00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.990
What if the cops trace the car back to us?
